      "en": "They will do these thingsbecause they have not known the Father nor me.",
      "ko": "저희가 이런 일을 할 것은 아버지와 나를 알지 못함이라",
      "source_text_hash": "31c9afde7f131f4bc9272442bc69733c065626df2ba040c47d24a12b60dd3759",
      "translation_text_hash": "3808a9f85fbf21b35f29e3713c5dcdf043d24cbb05f8206252be45083dd9d605",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
      "source_edition": "KRV-1961",
      "mapping_type": "normal",
      "mapping_note": null,
      "raw_texts": [
        "저희가 이런 일을 할 것은 아버지와 나를 알지 못함이라"
      ],
      "raw_text_hashes": [
        "3808a9f85fbf21b35f29e3713c5dcdf043d24cbb05f8206252be45083dd9d605"
      ]
