      "en": "When he has come, he will convict the world about sin, about righteousness, and about judgment;",
      "ko": "그가 와서 죄에 대하여, 의에 대하여, 심판에 대하여 세상을 책망하시리라",
      "source_text_hash": "7136fbd91ae46ff1461741cc7c8fbae05d982c2d2ab85f07635a44ed91c0176f",
      "translation_text_hash": "78346d8cfd08ef3c7baaec371befea14cc5a49c4d828c384813cdb44e6f5ea9c",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
