      "en": "They said therefore, “What is this that he says, ‘A little while’? We don’t know what he is saying.”",
      "ko": "또 말하되 조금 있으면이라한 말씀이 무슨 말씀이뇨 무엇을 말씀하시는지 알지 못하노라 하거늘",
      "source_text_hash": "f1df68ec243c66fed66ab62eb134be060532c667a9eee3e7ac432de9fb44986d",
      "translation_text_hash": "0d628b0478164dc09b91e4e88f3aed58fd8f79826be307716768b8d1b3615b5e",
