      "en": "Therefore Jesus perceived that they wanted to ask him, and he said to them, “Do you inquire among yourselves concerning this, that I said, ‘A little while, and you won’t see me, and again a little while, and you will see me’?",
      "ko": "예수께서 그 묻고자 함을 아시고 가라사대 내 말이 조금 있으면 나를 보지 못하겠고 또 조금 있으면 나를 보리라 하므로 서로 문의하느냐",
      "source_text_hash": "4ad6c2a8cb2b7f2daee9ef8ea051ff07bb433efe471f9f3a7d41c586f9e05b90",
      "translation_text_hash": "b756d45219ab4a83876554c795f774a7f11f460be316272a9901d997673acaf0",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
